uo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and July to August came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those 75 years. In 2025 on the middle, August to September came in at 49% of normal and November to December at 61%. In 2026 so far on the middle, January to February came in at 30% of normal. Grid 25085 hit its driest year in 1963 at 64%, and a preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 there reads 175.0.</p>"}
